      "value": "Ring of the Skies"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "This ring, when worn, allows me to "
        },
        {
          "text": "cast more movement spells (such as Blink or Fling) while I am airborne before I need to touch the ground again",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ". It seems to give one additional cast out the gate, plus an additional one for each tier of power I have attained. \n\nIt also seems to specifically augment "
        },
        {
          "text": "Fling",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": ", allowing it to "
        },
        {
          "text": "safely move me without fear of smashing into walls",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": " (though falling still can be perilous), and it seems to "
        },
        {
          "text": "make the flinging effect stronger",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": "."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
